1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,283
A group is a set with an operation satisfying four axioms.

2
00:00:04,283 --> 00:00:05,234
Closure.

3
00:00:05,234 --> 00:00:06,718
Associativity.

4
00:00:06,718 --> 00:00:09,570
An identity element that changes nothing.

5
00:00:09,570 --> 00:00:14,270
And an inverse for every element that brings it back to the identity.

6
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:18,632
If the order of combining never matters, the group is abelian.

7
00:00:18,632 --> 00:00:21,171
Its order is the number of elements.

